      "content": "thanks, these are a good start. i noticed you mentioned the 'International Aristocrat' skews towards European or Middle Eastern backgrounds. can you expand a bit on why you'd exclude other high-net-worth groups, like highly successful Asian or African elites, from that specific 'aristocratic' profile? i want to make sure our segmentation isn't too narrow or missing the mark on who actually holds that kind of traditional luxury status.",
